{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"799","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"C. Fountains"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Arkady plays Gardenscapes a lot. Arkady wants to build two new fountains. There are "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" available fountains, for each fountain its beauty and cost are known. There are two types of money in the game: coins and diamonds, so each fountain cost can be either in coins or diamonds. No money changes between the types are allowed."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Help Arkady to find two fountains with maximum total beauty so that he can buy both at the same time."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains three integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"c"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"d"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2 ≤ n ≤ 100 000"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"0 ≤ c, d ≤ 100 000"},{"kind":"text","text":") — the number of fountains, the number of coins and diamonds Arkady has."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The next "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines describe fountains. Each of these lines contain two integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"bi"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"pi"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ bi, pi ≤ 100 000"},{"kind":"text","text":") — the beauty and the cost of the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th fountain, and then a letter \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"C"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" or \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"D"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", describing in which type of money is the cost of fountain "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":": in coins or in diamonds, respectively."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print the maximum total beauty of exactly two fountains Arkady can build. If he can't build two fountains, print "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"0"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3 7 6\n10 8 C\n4 3 C\n5 6 D\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"9\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2 4 5\n2 5 C\n2 1 D\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"0\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3 10 10\n5 5 C\n5 5 C\n10 11 D\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"10\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first example Arkady should build the second fountain with beauty "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"4"},{"kind":"text","text":", which costs "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"3"},{"kind":"text","text":" coins. The first fountain he can't build because he don't have enough coins. Also Arkady should build the third fountain with beauty "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"5"},{"kind":"text","text":" which costs "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"6"},{"kind":"text","text":" diamonds. Thus the total beauty of built fountains is "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"9"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second example there are two fountains, but Arkady can't build both of them, because he needs "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"5"},{"kind":"text","text":" coins for the first fountain, and Arkady has only "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"4"},{"kind":"text","text":" coins. "}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"C","problemCode":"799C","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/799/proble